NO FLAG RAISED. No field data shows a problem. None is cleared either, because no field data shows a durable fleet. The brief carries shares, not cycles. Hot and harsh service first.
- Ducted (ready 2036; on NGSA since 2037, 13 years; on fps since 2040, 10 years): no time-on-wing, shop-visit, removal or inspection data in my brief or record. Watch item, not a flag (inference from the LEAP history): hot and harsh service, where LEAP fell short in the Middle East and India through 'a small, handful of parts'.
